<h1>Preferences - Display - Colours</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Colour settings are used for defining the colours of the objects, visual elements, background, and lighting of the scene.</p>
<p><img src="Images/preferences_colours.gif" width="593px" height="367px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
