<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Colour selection rectangle</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">This rectangle shows the colour of the selected item from the scene element list. Click on the rectangle to call the standard Windows colour selection dialog to set the new colour.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">Default</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Press this button to set the default colour for the selected scene element.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">All to default</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Press this button to set default colours for all scene elements.</p>
<p class="sub-head">Colour schemes group</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">There is a set of predefined colour schemes that are stored in materials.clr file located in KUBE home directory. Do not edit this file manually all changes must be made through Display Settings dialog.</p>
